  (text "J1 = USB-C 16 pin receptacle, USB 2.0 only: D+/D- + CC used, SBU open, shell to GND\nR3, R4 = 5.1k CC pulldowns = tells the source it is a sink -> 5V on VBUS. one per CC pin @ USBC spec p161\nCC ends at R3/R4, no MCU pin -> default USB power ONLY @ USBC spec p201\nD1 = ESD array on D+, D-, VBUS: 1 = D-, 3 = D+, 2 = GND, 5 = VBUS @ DS p2\nworking voltage 5.5V max @ DS p3 = the most a source may put on VBUS @ USBC spec p152\n1.25pF typ / 1.3 max per line @ DS p3 so no affect on full speed 12Mbps @ PS p850\nD1 does NOT protect the MCU VBUS pin: breakdown >= 6.6V @ DS p3, pin abs max 5.8V @ PS p972"
    (at 20.32 139.7 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "4e302034-67a8-43c6-9929-a3817e793982")
  )
